      <th>Categories</th>
      <th>Vacancies Assessment Up To</th>
      <th>Assessment of Vacancies in OIRMS</th>
      <th>Indenting of Vacancies in OIRMS after Approval</th>
      <th>Proposal for Draft CEN</th>
